// 端点只做两件事：线上整数换成笔刷（越界拒绝、不截断），terrainmap 的拒绝换成业务码。校验、去重、事务与同步见
// internal/service/<game>/terrain_test.go 与 terrain_sync_test.go。

func codeOf(err error) int32 {
	code, _ := errcode.ClientError(err)
	return code
}

// 没配地形的服务器答 terrain_disabled，不是内部错误。
func TestTerrainEditWithoutTerrainAnswersDisabled(t *testing.T) {
	if terrainmap.Active() != nil {
		t.Skip("a terrain map is installed in this process")
	}
	controller := &Controller{registry: app.NewRegistry(viper.New())}
	response, err := controller.HandleTerrainEdit(&playeraccess.Context{BaseCtx: context.Background(), PlayerID: 7, MsgID: msgid.MsgTerrainEdit, Seq: 1},
		&pb.TerrainEditRequest{Seq: 1, Op: int32(terrain.BrushRaise), Radius: 500, Strength: 1})
	if err != nil {
		t.Fatal(err)
	}
	if response.Code != codeOf(apperrors.ErrTerrainDisabled) {
		t.Fatalf("code %d (%s), want terrain_disabled", response.Code, response.Reason)
	}
}

// 越出字段类型范围的值拒绝：截断会把一个非法请求变成另一个合法请求（例如强度 65537 变成 1）。
func TestTerrainEditRefusesWireValuesOutsideTheirFields(t *testing.T) {
	valid := pb.TerrainEditRequest{Seq: 1, Op: int32(terrain.BrushFlatten), X: 300, Y: 400, Radius: 500, Falloff: int32(terrain.FalloffSmooth), Strength: 20, Target: 1500, Material: 7}
	brush, ok := brushOf(&valid)
	want := terrain.Brush{Op: terrain.BrushFlatten, X: 300, Y: 400, Radius: 500, Falloff: terrain.FalloffSmooth, Strength: 20, Target: 1500, Material: 7}
	if !ok || brush != want {
		t.Fatalf("brushOf(valid) = %+v, %v; want %+v", brush, ok, want)
	}
	for name, mutate := range map[string]func(*pb.TerrainEditRequest){
		"op over a byte":        func(r *pb.TerrainEditRequest) { r.Op = 256 },
		"negative op":           func(r *pb.TerrainEditRequest) { r.Op = -1 },
		"falloff over a byte":   func(r *pb.TerrainEditRequest) { r.Falloff = 256 },
		"strength over uint16":  func(r *pb.TerrainEditRequest) { r.Strength = math.MaxUint16 + 2 },
		"negative strength":     func(r *pb.TerrainEditRequest) { r.Strength = -1 },
		"target over uint16":    func(r *pb.TerrainEditRequest) { r.Target = math.MaxUint16 + 1 },
		"material over a byte":  func(r *pb.TerrainEditRequest) { r.Material = 256 },
		"negative material":     func(r *pb.TerrainEditRequest) { r.Material = -3 },
	} {
		request := valid
		mutate(&request)
		if _, ok := brushOf(&request); ok {
			t.Errorf("%s: accepted", name)
		}
	}
}

// 每个拒绝对应一个业务码（包在别的错误里也认得出）；别的错误原样返回，答 internal。
func TestTerrainRefusalsMapToTheirCodes(t *testing.T) {
	for _, c := range []struct {
		err  error
		want error
	}{
		{terrainmap.ErrDisabled, apperrors.ErrTerrainDisabled},
		{terrainmap.ErrBrush, apperrors.ErrTerrainBrush},
		{terrainmap.ErrNotOwned, apperrors.ErrTerrainNotOwned},
		{terrainmap.ErrUnloadable, apperrors.ErrTerrainUnavailable},
		{terrain.ErrNotLoaded, apperrors.ErrTerrainUnavailable},
		{terrainmap.ErrRateLimited, apperrors.ErrTerrainRate},
		{terrainmap.ErrDenied, apperrors.ErrTerrainDenied},
		{terrainmap.ErrOccupied, apperrors.ErrTerrainOccupied},
		{terrainmap.ErrStale, apperrors.ErrTerrainSeq},
		{terrainmap.ErrSeqAhead, apperrors.ErrTerrainSeq},
		{&terrainmap.SeqError{Seq: 3, LastSeq: 900, Verdict: terrain_editor.Stale}, apperrors.ErrTerrainSeq},
		{&terrainmap.SeqError{Seq: 9_000_000, LastSeq: 900, Verdict: terrain_editor.Ahead}, apperrors.ErrTerrainSeq},
		{terrainmap.ErrPending, apperrors.ErrTerrainPending},
	} {
		wrapped := fmt.Errorf("terrain: brush at (1, 2): %w", c.err)
		if got := terrainError(wrapped); !errors.Is(got, c.want) || codeOf(got) == errcode.CodeInternal {
			t.Errorf("%v mapped to %v (code %d), want %v", c.err, got, codeOf(got), c.want)
		}
	}
	other := errors.New("wal: disk full")
	if got := terrainError(other); got != other || codeOf(got) != errcode.CodeInternal {
		t.Fatalf("an infrastructure error mapped to %v (code %d)", got, codeOf(got))
	}
}

// 序号不在窗口里的拒绝（*SeqError）答 terrain_seq 并带上 LastSeq，客户端据此判断“太旧”还是“跳太远”并续号；别的拒绝
// 不带 LastSeq。
func TestTerrainSeqRefusalCarriesTheLastSeq(t *testing.T) {
	access := &playeraccess.Context{BaseCtx: context.Background(), PlayerID: 7, MsgID: msgid.MsgTerrainEdit, Seq: 1}
	request := &pb.TerrainEditRequest{Seq: 3}
	stale := fmt.Errorf("terrain: brush: %w", &terrainmap.SeqError{PlayerID: 7, Seq: 3, LastSeq: 900, Verdict: terrain_editor.Stale})
	if r := terrainRefusal(access, request, stale); r.Code != codeOf(apperrors.ErrTerrainSeq) || r.LastSeq != 900 {
		t.Fatalf("a stale sequence: %+v, want terrain_seq with LastSeq 900", r)
	}
	if r := terrainRefusal(access, request, terrainmap.ErrOccupied); r.Code != codeOf(apperrors.ErrTerrainOccupied) || r.LastSeq != 0 {
		t.Fatalf("an occupied refusal: %+v, want terrain_occupied without LastSeq", r)
	}
}

// 分区场景的转发编辑（P5）：答复逐块带结论——执行了 / 以前执行过的格列出它答回的块与版本，拒绝 / 结果未知的格列出
// 它那一部分的块（版本 0）；汇总码：有结果未知的答 terrain_pending（不论别的格），否则第一个拒绝的原因；格答回的
// 没有归类的失败答 internal。
func TestTerrainRelayAnswerCarriesEachCellsOutcome(t *testing.T) {
	access := &playeraccess.Context{BaseCtx: context.Background(), PlayerID: 7, MsgID: msgid.MsgTerrainEdit, Seq: 1}
	left, right := terrain.ChunkKey{X: 3}, terrain.ChunkKey{X: 4}
	applied := terrainmap.RelayPart{SID: 101, Chunks: []terrain.ChunkKey{left}, Answer: terrainmap.PartAnswer{
		Outcome: terrainmap.OutcomeApplied, Chunks: []terrain_chunk.ChunkVersion{{Key: left, Version: 5}}}}
	refused := terrainmap.RelayPart{SID: 102, Chunks: []terrain.ChunkKey{right}, Answer: terrainmap.PartAnswer{
		Outcome: terrainmap.OutcomeRefused, Refusal: terrainmap.RefusalErr(terrainmap.RefusalCode(terrainmap.ErrOccupied), "point 9")}}
	unknown := refused
	unknown.Answer = terrainmap.PartAnswer{Outcome: terrainmap.OutcomeUnknown, Refusal: errors.New("no answer")}
	failed := refused
	failed.Answer = terrainmap.PartAnswer{Outcome: terrainmap.OutcomeRefused, Refusal: terrainmap.RefusalErr(0, "disk")}
	for _, c := range []struct {
		name   string
		parts  []terrainmap.RelayPart
		code   int32
		chunks []pb.TerrainChunkVersion
	}{
		{"both done", []terrainmap.RelayPart{applied}, 0, []pb.TerrainChunkVersion{{ChunkX: 3, Version: 5, Outcome: 1}}},
		{"one refused", []terrainmap.RelayPart{applied, refused}, codeOf(apperrors.ErrTerrainOccupied),
			[]pb.TerrainChunkVersion{{ChunkX: 3, Version: 5, Outcome: 1}, {ChunkX: 4, Outcome: 3}}},
		{"one unknown", []terrainmap.RelayPart{applied, unknown}, codeOf(apperrors.ErrTerrainPending),
			[]pb.TerrainChunkVersion{{ChunkX: 3, Version: 5, Outcome: 1}, {ChunkX: 4, Outcome: 4}}},
		{"an unclassified failure", []terrainmap.RelayPart{applied, failed}, errcode.CodeInternal,
			[]pb.TerrainChunkVersion{{ChunkX: 3, Version: 5, Outcome: 1}, {ChunkX: 4, Outcome: 3}}},
	} {
		result := terrainmap.RelayResult{Parts: c.parts, LastSeq: 9}
		code, _ := relayCode(access, 9, result, terrainError)
		if code != c.code || !slices.Equal(relayChunks(result), c.chunks) {
			t.Errorf("%s: code %d chunks %+v, want %d %+v", c.name, code, relayChunks(result), c.code, c.chunks)
		}
	}
}
